{"id":"n23193-2-8","stage":3,"title":"눈부시다 · 灿烂","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23193-2-8-1","ko":"오늘 신경 써서 옷을 차려입었는데 제 모습이 어때요?","zh":"我今天特意精心打扮了，看起来怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"신경","meaning":"心思、心神","explanation":"신경：心思、心神（신경 쓰다：用心、费心）。","readings":[{"term":"신경","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13994","senseId":"2","lemma":"신경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신경","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3"}},{"text":"써서","meaning":"用心、费心（신경 쓰다）","explanation":"쓰다：用心、费心（신경 쓰다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"6","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"써서","audio":"/audio/3314fd01207eddd42fec.mp3"}},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷을","audio":"/audio/76fa7acf1b0008045d0c.mp3"}},{"text":"차려입었는데","meaning":"穿着讲究","explanation":"차려입다：穿着讲究；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"차려입다","audio":"/audio/bfe610e56341649077cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82458","senseId":"1","lemma":"차려입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차려입었는데","audio":"/audio/02c789109a607883b827.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"모습이","meaning":"样子，模样","explanation":"모습：样子，模样；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"모습","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62383","senseId":"1","lemma":"모습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모습이","audio":"/audio/b66e8741dfdc88b47306.mp3"}},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때요","audio":"/audio/6dbf157a4dc7e6e8b537.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"601d03a22ce3fa90","term":"신경","zh":"心思、心神（신경 쓰다：用心、费心）","audio":"/audio/601d03a22ce3fa90ef0a.mp3","entryId":"13994","definition":"心思、心神（신경 쓰다：用心、费心）","pronunciation":["신경"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用心、费心（신경 쓰다）","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"用心、费心（신경 쓰다）","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"bfe610e563416490","term":"차려입다","zh":"穿着讲究","audio":"/audio/bfe610e56341649077cf.mp3","entryId":"82458","definition":"穿得很搭配。","pronunciation":["차려입따"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"4b8858fa4bec51bc","term":"모습","zh":"样子，模样","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3","entryId":"62383","definition":"人或事物的长相。","pronunciation":["모습"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term"